<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήγρετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νη-, ἐγείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unwaking,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήγρετος ὕπνος</span>
			<i>sound</i> sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				177
			</span></i>; of death, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὕδομες εὖ μάλα μακρὸν ἀτέρμονα ν.
					ὕπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					3.104
				</span></i>
			: in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>: neut. as Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήγρετον</span>
			<i>without waking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. εὕδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.74
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ὑπνοῦν,</span> of death, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.305
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adaeus</span>).</div>
